{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of your robotic craftsmanship journey on the frozen planet Xylaris-9 \u2014 a distant world where technology and trade define survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you take your first steps as a customizable robotic engineer, operating within your personal assembly lab. Your mission: design, build, and deliver robots to four influential factions \u2014 The Syndicate, The Federation, The Nomad Collective, and The Eclipse Authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.poster.avif?t=1762092830\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.webm?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.mp4?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each faction sends unique robot requests.. Earn credits, boost your reputation, and unlock improved efficiency as you rise through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in this demo version, your progress is limited to Reputation Level 2, marking the end of the playable session once achieved. Some systems, such as Research and Storage Upgrades, are disabled for this early preview. Additionally, only two cargo ships are available, allowing a glimpse into the game\u2019s full logistics and trading depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.poster.avif?t=1762092830\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.webm?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.mp4?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your time on Xylaris-9 is limited in DEMO, use it wisely. Optimize your production chain, manage your Crafting Tubes, and deliver the most efficient robots possible before your demo session concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft with precision. Trade with purpose.Discover the foundation of your robotic empire in the Robodeal Simulator Demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4120720?t=1762092830","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/ebfa08ba26455e2ac8fd557c6112e239d7c7019f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762092830","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762092830","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/63e0c49ddc5583fc9e9dd933aa183f4385a8a304/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762092830","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the beginning of your robotic craftsmanship journey on the frozen planet Xylaris-9 \u2014 a distant world where technology and trade define survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this demo, you take your first steps as a customizable robotic engineer, operating within your personal assembly lab. Your mission: design, build, and deliver robots to four influential factions \u2014 The Syndicate, The Federation, The Nomad Collective, and The Eclipse Authority.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.poster.avif?t=1762092830\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.webm?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/1bb6f0e038eeaf50ad2fc941f403ceb2.mp4?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Each faction sends unique robot requests.. Earn credits, boost your reputation, and unlock improved efficiency as you rise through the ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, in this demo version, your progress is limited to Reputation Level 2, marking the end of the playable session once achieved. Some systems, such as Research and Storage Upgrades, are disabled for this early preview. Additionally, only two cargo ships are available, allowing a glimpse into the game\u2019s full logistics and trading depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.poster.avif?t=1762092830\" width=960 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.webm?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/extras/bf2688d1d5ef3bc26769b16b5a451335.mp4?t=1762092830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Your time on Xylaris-9 is limited in DEMO, use it wisely. Optimize your production chain, manage your Crafting Tubes, and deliver the most efficient robots possible before your demo session concludes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft with precision. Trade with purpose.Discover the foundation of your robotic empire in the Robodeal Simulator Demo.</p>","developers":[" Dual Cluster Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"4088760","name":"RoboDeal Simulator"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120720/a72c3e4aae4c0a7be732e422285482a978e25306/header.jpg?t=1762092830","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4120720/1289708136/e1e0ad2479870d86dfabb457ff38746fa3f83b42/1762088319/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762092828","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4120720/1289708136/e1e0ad2479870d86dfabb457ff38746fa3f83b42/1762088319/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762092828","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4120720/1289708136/e1e0ad2479870d86dfabb457ff38746fa3f83b42/1762088319/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762092828","id":257225767,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225767/movie480.mp4?t=1762092828","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225767/movie_max.mp4?t=1762092828"},"name":"RoboDealSimulatorDemoFragman","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257225767/d698b45f5011457dd4f4a1c14d7eb47ba562c32d/movie_600x337.j